#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""okama-shell — OkamaOS v2.0.4 fullscreen controller-first UI shell.

MAJOR UPDATE: Cyberpunk UI, Full Keyboard/Generic Controller Support,
Network Status, Online Indicators, Bluetooth Plug-and-Play

Designed for Pygame on a framebuffer. No window manager, no desktop.
Keyboard is now fully supported alongside controllers.

Boot flow: init → S99okama-shell → okama-shell (loops forever)
In-shell flow: home → navigate sections → launch game → game exits → home

Sections:
  Play | Settings | Power

Controller mapping (reads from okama-inputd socket):
  D-pad / LSTICK: navigate
  A: select
  B: back
  START: home
  HOME: quick-menu
  L1/R1: tab between sections

Keyboard (full support):
  Arrow keys → navigation
  Enter/Space → select
  Esc/Backspace → back
  Tab → next section
  1-3 → direct section select
"""

